:"The Files panel stays open when you switch between sessions",id:"Jdr9gPxUIc"})},{kind:"improvement",text:dA({defaultMessage:"Usage-limit notices now say which limit you hit and when it resets",id:"0bIJknc5LK"})},{kind:"improvement",text:dA({defaultMessage:"Press a number key to pick an option when Claude asks a question",id:"icn8CM+0cV"})},{kind:"fix",text:dA({defaultMessage:"Opening a very large repository no longer crashes on startup",id:"Vqd9xnOl2k"})},{kind:"fix",text:dA({defaultMessage:"The diff panel and file previews work in SSH sessions",id:"gC9+SjQopv"})},{kind:"fix",text:dA({defaultMessage:"Sessions in their own window stay responsive when the main window is hidden",id:"VHhN1KfmCH"})},{kind:"fix",text:dA({defaultMessage:"Archiving or deleting a session works while it's starting up or responding",id:"hEM4asyIjl"})}]},{version:"1.9659.0",date:"2026-05-28",items:[{kind:"feat",text:dA({defaultMessage:"Claude Opus 4.8 is now available in the model picker",id:"BBdIiDX7hr"})},{kind:"feat",text:dA({defaultMessage:"Dynamic workflows let Claude fan out to many subagents on a single task",id:"8By5nlWG7I"})},{kind:"feat",text:dA({defaultMessage:"Your `WorktreeCreate` and `WorktreeRemove` hooks run for local sessions too \u2014 jj and Sapling setups can use worktree isolation",id:"de6C2Wzbse"})},{kind:"fix",text:dA({defaultMessage:"Searching file contents with `?` works for folders that aren't git repos",id:"CjsWsZhIqS"})},{kind:"fix",text:dA({defaultMessage:"Agents you define in your project's `.claude/agents` show up in the `@`-mention picker \u2014 and new ones appear without a restart",id:"JjAk5QHGza"})},{kind:"fix",text:dA({defaultMessage:"The PR bar finds your open PR even when your local branch name doesn't match the remote's",id:"dN1nhuij65"})},{kind:"fix",text:dA({defaultMessage:"Local video attachments play in the lightbox",id:"6p+YJwQX1o"})},{kind:"fix",text:dA({defaultMessage:"Starting a session on a branch works with macOS's built-in git",id:"VZeCi0uoZQ"