can do",id:"nVMbQAH3By"},connectToolPrompt:{defaultMessage:"Hey Claude, I'm new to Cowork. Can you help me connect to my tools? First ask me which ones I use every day, and then help me connect them. Afterwards, give me ideas about what you can do with the new information you have.",id:"S5PVDSSL9x"},installPluginTitle:{defaultMessage:"Customize Claude to your role",id:"tVTEVxlYhS"},installPluginSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Add ready-made tools and workflows",id:"TSSIvgJO4U"},installPluginPrompt:{defaultMessage:"Hey Claude, I'm new to Cowork. Can you help me find plugins to install? First ask me what my role is if you don't already know. Afterwards, suggest some plugins that match my role and show me one I should install first.",id:"WLuiV1tqyY"},scheduleTaskTitle:{defaultMessage:"Schedule a recurring task",id:"Cs2Rf1AkqB"},scheduleTaskSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Great for reminders, reports, or regular check-ins",id:"42p5zYzhtq"},scheduleTaskPrompt:{defaultMessage:"Hey Claude, I want to try scheduling a recurring task. Can you walk me through it? Ask me if I have something regular I'd like to automate. If I can't think of anything, suggest something and help me set it up. If I haven't connected the tools you'd need yet, help me do that first.",id:"837vvR3GKV"},dailyBriefingTitle:{defaultMessage:"Create a daily briefing",id:"YgieKqhWMt"},dailyBriefingSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"A morning rundown of what's on your plate and what changed overnight",id:"IwRpAUVLU+"},dailyBriefingPrompt:{defaultMessage:"Hey Claude, I'd like a daily briefing. Help me set up a scheduled task that runs each morning and pulls together what I should know \u2014 calendar, unread messages, anything that changed overnight in my connected tools. Ask me what time and which sources to include, then schedule it.",id:"ONuJayg0Gg"},enableNotificationsTitle:{defaultMessage:"Turn on notifications",id:"IXFS1bytWQ"},enableNotificationsSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Claude can ping you when it finishes work or needs your input",id:"1sLNHR3kra"},setHotkeyTitle:{defaultMessage:"Set a global shortcut",id:"uPBNGtxydc"},setHotkeySubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Open Cowork from anywhere",id:"jMcbT6jU3G"},enableDispatchTitle:{defaultMessage:"Pair your phone",id:"VJXGlQsyZ5"},enableDispatchSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Send tasks from your phone for Claude to run here",id:"TQbWCEnEIe"},importMemoryTitle:{defaultMessage:"Turn on memory",id:"5OIWPYyjEY"},importMemorySubtitle:{defaultMessage:"So Claude gets to know you more with every chat",id:"u23s4RIaPS"}}),nGt=uA({salesVideoTitle:{defaultMessage:"Watch how an AE uses Cowork",id:"zRpLoiivTL"},salesVideoSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"From full account brief to action items and follow-ups.",id:"TqFdXYSIS5"},salesSetupTitle:{defaultMessage:"Customize Claude for sales",id:"00nnfy3wIO"},salesSetupSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Add skills for account research, call prep, and follow-ups",id:"zZDKeegJjX"},salesScheduleTitle:{defaultMessage:"Schedule your morning prep",id:"dmsv6WHr7h"},salesScheduleSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Get a daily rundown of meetings, recent threads, and prospect news",id:"tv0i6r82kR"},salesSchedulePrompt:{defaultMessage:"Every weekday morning, put together a prep brief for my day: the meetings on my calendar and useful context on who I'm meeting, the email and Slack threads I still owe a reply, and any recent news on the accounts and prospects I'm working. Set this to run automatically each weekday around 8am so it's waiting for me when I start. If you don't have access to my calendar, inbox, or CRM yet, pull up the right connectors for me so I can add them right here.",id:"GB8m2A1hn2"},marketingVideoTitle:{defaultMessage:"Watch marketing ops in Cowork",id:"Cbrf/K6zTu"},marketingVideoSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"See a weekly review built, shipped, then improved for next week.",id:"vbZ45aApm9"},marketingSetupTitle:{defaultMessage:"Customize Claude for marketing",id:"OcwidY9Oq4"},marketingSetupSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Add skills for campaign reports, brand voice, and content creation",id:"rty2kLWuQt"},marketingScheduleTitle:{defaultMessage:"Schedule a weekly metrics review",id:"yk+KfczGTl"},marketingScheduleSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Spend, conversions, and what to watch, drafted weekly for your team",id:"1io+DOU81q"},marketingSchedulePrompt:{defaultMessage:"Each week, draft a metrics review I can share with my team: where we are on spend, how conversions and campaign performance are trending versus last week, and the two or three things worth watching or acting on. Set it to run automatically every Monday morning so the draft is ready before the week kicks off. If you don't have access to our analytics, ad platforms, or spreadsheets yet, surface the right connectors for me so I can connect them right here.",id:"U96YvBo3F5"},financeSetupTitle:{defaultMessage:"Customize Claude for finance",id:"aZzzLN0WXO"},financeSetupSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Add skills for variance analysis, reconciliations, and journal entries",id:"xvfHjXbDgD"},financeConnectTitle:{defaultMessage:"Connect your books",id:"51vRTEsacZ"},financeConnectSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Pull actuals and expenses from NetSuite, Stripe, or Brex",id:"Qvsk3V51y1"},financeConnectPrompt:{defaultMessage:"Connect my books so you can see our actuals and expenses. Surface the NetSuite, Stripe, and Brex connectors so I can hook up whichever we use \u2014 or, if one's already connected, just confirm what you can see.",id:"1zwutm0pLh"},financeScheduleTitle:{defaultMessage:"Schedule your close prep",id:"TOQiHnyqMj"},financeScheduleSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"A close pack with variance drivers before month-end",id:"ld7vrZfDXr"},financeSchedulePrompt:{defaultMessage:"A few days before month-end, put together a close prep pack: actuals versus budget and versus last month, the variances that matter, and a short note on what's driving each one so I can get a head start on the close. Set it to run automatically each month ahead of month-end. If you can't see our accounting and expense systems yet, surface the right connectors for me so I can connect them right here.",id:"NA8UkX3gci"},pmSetupTitle:{defaultMessage:"Customize Claude for PM work",id:"eTbxj4xk9C"},pmSetupSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Add skills for feedback synthesis, PRDs, and metrics",id:"HVtSr0joFi"},pmConnectTitle:{defaultMessage:"Connect your backlog",id:"aZ3ZBneEdV"},pmConnectSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Linear, Jira, or GitHub\u2014so Claude can see what's shipping",id:"ZAtl/5UX8d"},pmConnectPrompt:{defaultMessage:"Connect our backlog so you can see what's shipping. Surface the Linear, Jira, and GitHub connectors so I can hook up whichever we use \u2014 or, if one's already connected, just confirm what you can see.",id:"0VqpBZtV5d"},pmScheduleTitle:{defaultMessage:"Schedule a weekly digest",id:"wUUbFaQQHz"},pmScheduleSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"This week's feedback themes, drafted and ready Monday morning",id:"7EbH8hxlzW"},pmSchedulePrompt:{defaultMessage:"Each week, go through the user and customer feedback we've collected and draft a digest of the main themes \u2014 what people are asking for, what's frustrating them, and anything coming up more than it used to \u2014 with example quotes and where they came from. Set it to run automatically every Monday morning so it's ready when I start the week. If you can't see our feedback sources yet \u2014 support tickets, surveys, call notes, or a feedback tool \u2014 surface the right connectors for me so I can connect them right here.",id:"Iba8/izEmK"}}),aGt=[{id:"first_task",title:sGt.firstTaskTitle,subtitle:sGt.firstTaskSubtitle,action:{kind:"session_prompt",prompt:sGt.firstTaskPrompt},useIsComplete:function(){return!1===RN()}},{id:"connect_tool",title:sGt.connectToolTitle,subtitle:sGt.connectToolSubtitle,action:{kind:"session_prompt",prompt:sGt.connectToolPrompt},useIsComplete:()=>function(){const t=wn(e=>e.remoteServers);return e.useMemo(()=>{let e=0;for(const s of Object.values(t))s&&!va(s.name)&&e++;return e},[t])}()>=1},{id:"i